<[Dennis] D.RUFFER> which works in ALL GEnie editors...
<[Dennis] D.RUFFER> that it adds an extra space to the end of lines...
<[Dennis] D.RUFFER> thus as the formater wraps the line...
<[Dennis] D.RUFFER> you get two spaces where you typed a return...
<[Dennis] D.RUFFER> otherwise it works fine.
